{"appendix":false,"contribution_target":{"fingerprint":"sha256:609775731cca7b0de45d245d38a561f40a8387c79dd311f33a10d3ccb210c940","grain":"paper-statement","id":"The-entropy-photon-number-inequality-September-24-2026#thm:epni","title":"Entropy photon-number inequality"},"credit":{"kind":"producer-declared","license":null,"license_status":"consult-source-notice","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","repository":"https://github.com/openai/math","source":"lean/formalization.yaml","source_registry":"index.json#/sources"},"detail":{"path":"../rows/b819c37cd6c2ae8cce4409e5.json","pointer":"/row"},"display":"Theorem","generation_id":"sha256:eb85d3603ec7254e8723f8292d2014fbb295087c537d4a9a7c22689061a82822","id":"r:The-entropy-photon-number-inequality-September-24-2026:thm:epni","kind":"statement-detail","manuscript_id":"p:The-entropy-photon-number-inequality-September-24-2026","name":"Entropy photon-number inequality","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","printed_number":"1.1","printed_number_provenance":{"atlas_pin":"f047bac96ee80ebef0b4f5a403831b84de6e32c1","binding":{"file":"build/sections/00-introduction.tex","label":"thm:epni","line":10,"manuscript":"The-entropy-photon-number-inequality-September-24-2026","statement_sha256":"d1c675ec431a67bec72ee7199ee0417662842135bd2bca677a68b672d1a45335"},"blob_sha256":"sha256:253ae0683558fd095a71d6f47ab0694d8d98b846c1a65d2bbf9b145d484af567","kind":"reading-page-computed","pdf_verified":false,"pin":"f047bac96ee80ebef0b4f5a403831b84de6e32c1","renderer":"scripts/build_papers.py","source":"data/statement_numbers.json","upstream_pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb"},"printed_number_status":"recorded","reading_page":"papers/The-entropy-photon-number-inequality-September-24-2026.html#thm:epni","release_id":"openai-math","schema":"statement-map-web/2","section":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:a881c40da6347d49d1c9677602f713bce719505a8d2a2553cb67e8876c8f63f1","file":"preprints/The-entropy-photon-number-inequality-September-24-2026/build/sections/00-introduction.tex","line":10,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"d1c675ec431a67bec72ee7199ee0417662842135bd2bca677a68b672d1a45335","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/The-entropy-photon-number-inequality-September-24-2026/build/sections/00-introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:a881c40da6347d49d1c9677602f713bce719505a8d2a2553cb67e8876c8f63f1","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/The-entropy-photon-number-inequality-September-24-2026/build/sections/00-introduction.tex#L10"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:epni}\nLet \\(n\\ge1\\) be finite, and let \\(\\rho_A,\\rho_B\\) be states on \\(n\\) bosonic modes, with annihilation operators \\(a_1,\\ldots,a_n\\) and \\(b_1,\\ldots,b_n\\), respectively, satisfying\n\\[\n \\Tr\\rho_A\\sum_{j=1}^n a_j^\\dagger a_j<\\infty,\n \\qquad\n \\Tr\\rho_B\\sum_{j=1}^n b_j^\\dagger b_j<\\infty.\n\\]\nThe joint input is \\(\\rho_A\\otimes\\rho_B\\); no independence assumption is made among the modes within either state. For \\(0\\le\\eta\\le1\\), let \\(\\rho_C\\) be the reduced state of the modes\n\\[\n c_j=\\sqrt\\eta\\,a_j+\\sqrt{1-\\eta}\\,b_j,\\qquad 1\\le j\\le n,\n\\]\nafter passive beam-splitter mixing. Then\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:epni}\n g^{-1}\\!\\left(\\frac{S(\\rho_C)}n\\right)\n \\ge \\eta\\,g^{-1}\\!\\left(\\frac{S(\\rho_A)}n\\right)\n +(1-\\eta)\\,g^{-1}\\!\\left(\\frac{S(\\rho_B)}n\\right),\n\\end{equation}\nwhere \\(S(\\rho)=-\\Tr\\rho\\log\\rho\\)."}
